From 546568a3253799f538cc5d5711487b2820ef01e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sureshkumar <suresure@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Apr 2026 15:16:17 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 10/11] Steering parameter & td fixes

            1. Operating Class Calculation Fix:
                            - Properly calculates operating class values for unassociated STA metrics and beacon reports

            2. Configurable Beacon Measurement Modes:
                            - Adds support for configurable 11k beacon measurement modes (Passive, Active, Table)

            3. TD RSSI Instantaneous Update:
                            - Updates network_map to use current RSSI values from stats_info

            4. TD Bandwidth Update:
                            - Updates network_map to use dynamic bandwidth from stats_info when available

            5. 1905 ACK Transmission:
                            - Implements proper ACK message transmission after controller receives beacon metric report

            6. Populate SSID & SSID Length details on 11k beacon metric query
                            - Accomodate respective SSID & length fields on 1905 beacon metric tlv to adhere spec

Signed-off-by: Sureshkumar <suresure@qti.qualcomm.com>
